{"title":"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(Smart_and_Fun!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (Smart and Fun!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The infinite product\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a14175298870f69d36ba1659437da6d34b31ae3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[3]{10} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots\\]\" width=\"204\" height=\"43\" />\nevaluates to a real number. What is that number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/58669832b19a56c4b8fda00b4c2151cba3f003f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\sqrt{10}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\sqrt[3]{100}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\sqrt[4]{1000}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }10\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }10\\sqrt[3]{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"509\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/4/9a414a76d3daf242ab82d4069a47d6a9b39428da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"36\" height=\"21\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/c/31c73a0eb5e08ac326da475ab8c938db8fd6a02b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 ^ \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"19\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/7/e8797d24c656db81f5590b6dd1cd96299a42f87c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}} = (10 ^ \\frac{1}{3}) ^ \\frac{1}{3} = 10 ^ \\frac{1}{3^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"191\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p><p>By continuing this, we get the form\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d5fb0d94d20028cb62feaa5265dab268fa4e78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10 ^ \\frac{1}{3} \\cdot 10 ^ \\frac{1}{3^2} \\cdot 10 ^ \\frac{1}{3^3} \\cdots,\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"21\" />\nwhich is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4ba313b8a301854a619c61e4095435f11f64645a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10 ^ {\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{3^2} + \\frac{1}{3^3} + \\cdots}.\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />\nUsing the formula for an infinite geometric series <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aac549850e9534c27b2a6eabccc5406e5a975ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{a}{1-r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"33\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3fb02e6bcb588355f1debc78a632d25064322cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{3^2} + \\frac{1}{3^3} + \\cdots = \\frac{\\frac{1}{3}}{1-\\frac{1}{3}} = \\frac{1}{2}.\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"47\" />\nThus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b14cdb5345229967a0cfb42a349141ab3b465b43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 ^ \\frac{1}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\sqrt{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"135\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p><p>- phuang1024\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can write this infinite product as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> (we know from the answer choices that the product must converge):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5ded3e8663e3424f44372047e8da32737150ac3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[L = \\sqrt[3]{10} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots.\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"43\" />\nIf we raise everything to the third power, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/1/a8144495c9ae8d630eb8ced96e3cc89a0800f4c2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[L^3 =  10 \\, \\cdot \\, \\sqrt[3]{10} \\, \\cdot \\, \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdots = 10L \\implies L^3 - 10L = 0 \\implies L \\in \\left\\{0, \\pm \\sqrt{10}\\right\\}.\\]\" width=\"575\" height=\"37\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is positive (as it is an infinite product of positive numbers), it must be that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d04f30bc4fef27ee5518a0c40b20fe399f899ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\sqrt{10}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"124\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~ Oxymoronic15\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Move the first term inside the second radical. We get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78877d15433a45a0711b1d7dd3bb16ed5fa6997.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[3]{10} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots = \\sqrt[3]{10\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots.\\]\" width=\"418\" height=\"43\" />\nDo this for the third radical as well:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cd6d600e2e529810b0c095e3472f714946e4ddd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[3]{10\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots = \\sqrt[3]{10\\sqrt[3]{10}\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots = \\sqrt[3]{10\\sqrt[3]{10\\sqrt[3]{10\\cdots}}}.\\]\" width=\"506\" height=\"43\" />\nIt is clear what the pattern is. Setting the answer as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/e/ede78a06018011f48c24a76284afce482ebc6c47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/2/112b34b1d18f0849184e48a496cfd0b7d8bfb271.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P = \\sqrt[3]{10P},\\]\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a851b8f9f191153d4dfb91ee355ed2808c8a853c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = \\boxed{\\sqrt{10}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"90\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~kxiang\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Set the product equal to P. We get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/3/5731ff6ee14050526d0101567ff4992e10a67cdf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[3]{10} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots=P\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"43\" /> Since this is an infinite product, there may exist a clever manipulation where we set two different espressions involving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> equal, from which we could solve for a number. Since all terms are raised to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> power, we can cube both sides of our equation. We would get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/c/2ccc0f1410cccf36b8042a566ad9957f5a5a00fd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10 \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{10} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}} \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt[3]{10}}} \\cdots=P^3\\]\" width=\"282\" height=\"43\" /> From this, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac7f5f3732625f938e3b941611aa8a749f00a8fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{P^3}{10}=P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"41\" />, and to this equation, the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282fb207f6c6f91de9159136e41ec5b5c2a50d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = \\boxed{\\sqrt{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"85\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~lmpofu\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution 1 (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_YDTIEuXTzY\">https://youtu.be/_YDTIEuXTzY</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28Smart_and_Fun.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(Smart_and_Fun!!!)\">Video Solution 2 (Smart and Fun!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (Smart and Fun!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7yAh4MtJ8a8?si=OJHbJh4_xMjBc9OY&amp;t=1397\">https://youtu.be/7yAh4MtJ8a8?si=OJHbJh4_xMjBc9OY&amp;t=1397</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A\">2022 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017022726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 239/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5751/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.606      1 -total\n 59.58%    7.511      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.63%    4.870      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23268:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017022726 and revision id 229037. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}